{
  "id": "LLoverdueRemindr",
  "name": "LendLoop: Overdue reminders",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "c5987806-0e11-4fcf-ae41-b7e15c6fcf7b",
      "name": "About this workflow",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -260,
        -460
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Overdue reminders\nRuns every day at 09:00 (instance time zone, `GENERIC_TIMEZONE`), or when an admin clicks **Run overdue check now** (signed webhook).\n\n1. **Fetch and claim** overdue loans: `POST /n8n/overdue-loans`, signed with the *n8n -> Convex* credential. Convex returns the loans that still need today's reminder and reserves each one for this run (30-minute lease), so an overlapping run (schedule + button, or a slow retry) gets nothing to send.\n2. For each loan, one at a time: email the borrower (3 tries), then write the status back with `POST /n8n/reminders`, keyed by `reminderKey` = `loanId:date`. `sent` is final, so retries and re-runs never create a second record or a second email; `failed` makes the loan eligible again on the next run.\n3. If any reminder failed, the run fails, which triggers **LendLoop: Error handler**.\n\nOne loan per iteration, so a retry can never re-send an email that already went out.",
        "width": 660,
        "height": 340,
        "color": 7
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d1a162b4-71f1-4397-a6cf-4198393e0265",
      "name": "Every day at 09:00",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.4,
      "position": [
        -240,
        -40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [
            {
              "field": "cronExpression",
              "expression": "0 0 9 * * *"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "0dd5e956-da66-4e75-adf5-cc55445fa356",
      "name": "Run now (admin button)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        -240,
        200
      ],
      "webhookId": "69e2bda7-127a-488a-a98a-d8dcb16f46a3",
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "lendloop/overdue-sweep",
        "authentication": "jwtAuth",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "jwtAuth": {
          "id": "LLjwtConvexToN8n",
          "name": "LendLoop: Convex -> n8n signing key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "101c37ba-249c-4b35-aa90-2178c209aba5",
      "name": "Sweep request from Convex?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.4,
      "position": [
        -20,
        200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 4
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "e64ecc5f-f2d9-4b69-a886-241b8b15758a",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.jwtPayload.iss }}",
              "rightValue": "lendloop-convex",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "69ab3a6e-dc68-47af-ab2c-d4673d4309a2",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.jwtPayload.aud }}",
              "rightValue": "lendloop-n8n",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            },
            {
              "id": "eb3e8ece-e524-4599-a7f6-b7b5b31f8135",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.jwtPayload.kind }}",
              "rightValue": "overdue_sweep",
              "operator": {
                "type": "string",
                "operation": "equals"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "d22a9fda-ea3f-49c5-a481-801bd47b3f39",
      "name": "Accept: 202",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        200,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "{\"status\":\"accepted\"}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 202
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "03f7074c-2e49-4d27-aa97-d5581f5f0e96",
      "name": "Reject: 400",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.5,
      "position": [
        200,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "{\"error\":\"invalid request\"}",
        "options": {
          "responseCode": 400
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "94ac64dd-b90a-40f5-a606-3e880da3c2de",
      "name": "Settings",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.5,
      "position": [
        420,
        -40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "dc7d6253-2e93-4faa-a21f-f6ab17eb9295",
              "name": "convexSiteUrl",
              "value": "http://convex-backend:3211",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "d1339721-3eb2-4830-adc8-f13b607b82c6",
              "name": "fromEmail",
              "value": "LendLoop <no-reply@lendloop.local>",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": true,
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5f479512-d971-4b7c-ad28-1300ff2af581",
      "name": "Sign claim request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.jwt",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        640,
        -40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "useJson": true,
        "claimsJson": "={{ JSON.stringify({ iss: 'lendloop-n8n', aud: 'lendloop-convex', scope: 'overdue-loans:claim', jti: 'overdue:' + $execution.id, exp: Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000) + 300, run: $execution.id }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "jwtAuth": {
          "id": "LLjwtN8nToConvex",
          "name": "LendLoop: n8n -> Convex signing key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fea68c40-a5b6-4431-a54b-58995544bb41",
      "name": "Fetch and claim overdue loans",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        860,
        -40
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.convexSiteUrl }}/n8n/overdue-loans",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{ $json.token }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "49808b35-00f1-442c-ab53-5e8e6bc98bc5",
      "name": "One item per loan",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitOut",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        1080,
        -40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "fieldToSplitOut": "loans",
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "80d7f01b-1ec2-417f-a0d8-209b85ee7096",
      "name": "One loan at a time",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.splitInBatches",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        1300,
        -40
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "batchSize": 1,
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e4c731ee-f329-486c-ab8d-b688b839fcf8",
      "name": "Email the borrower",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.emailSend",
      "typeVersion": 2.1,
      "position": [
        1520,
        80
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "onError": "continueRegularOutput",
      "parameters": {
        "fromEmail": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.fromEmail }}",
        "toEmail": "={{ $json.borrower.email }}",
        "subject": "=Reminder: please return the {{ $json.tool.name }}",
        "emailFormat": "text",
        "text": "=Hi {{ $json.borrower.name }},\n\nThe {{ $json.tool.name }} you borrowed from {{ $json.lender.name }} was due back on {{ DateTime.fromISO($json.dueDate, { zone: 'utc' }).toFormat('ccc d LLL') }}, {{ $json.daysOverdue }} day{{ $json.daysOverdue === 1 ? '' : 's' }} ago.\n\nPlease return it, or get in touch with {{ $json.lender.name }} through LendLoop if you need more time.\n\n– LendLoop",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "credentials": {
        "smtp": {
          "id": "LLsmtpMailpit001",
          "name": "LendLoop: SMTP (Mailpit)"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "43e0da73-0c82-4ff3-a852-65d4286cba56",
      "name": "Sign write-back",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.jwt",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1740,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "useJson": true,
        "claimsJson": "={{ JSON.stringify({ iss: 'lendloop-n8n', aud: 'lendloop-convex', scope: 'reminders:write', jti: $('One loan at a time').item.json.reminderKey, exp: Math.floor(Date.now() / 1000) + 300, reminderKey: $('One loan at a time').item.json.reminderKey, loanId: $('One loan at a time').item.json.loanId, status: $json.error ? 'failed' : 'sent', channel: 'email', error: $json.error ? String($json.error.message ?? $json.error) : undefined, executionId: $execution.id }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "credentials": {
        "jwtAuth": {
          "id": "LLjwtN8nToConvex",
          "name": "LendLoop: n8n -> Convex signing key"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5368e09c-661a-43b2-a2ff-13f1c05213c9",
      "name": "Write reminder status to Convex",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.5,
      "position": [
        1960,
        80
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 3,
      "waitBetweenTries": 5000,
      "parameters": {
        "method": "POST",
        "url": "={{ $('Settings').first().json.convexSiteUrl }}/n8n/reminders",
        "sendHeaders": true,
        "headerParameters": {
          "parameters": [
            {
              "name": "Authorization",
              "value": "=Bearer {{ $json.token }}"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {
          "timeout": 15000
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "f6f31e05-8694-495a-a366-b62acf0f1013",
      "name": "Result",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.5,
      "position": [
        2180,
        80
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "f28b0511-2dba-4190-ad37-04d80e7bbbc6",
              "name": "loanId",
              "value": "={{ $('One loan at a time').item.json.loanId }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "53906c0e-b4f7-4573-acc1-4edc038c4652",
              "name": "status",
              "value": "={{ $('Email the borrower').item.json.error ? 'failed' : 'sent' }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "includeOtherFields": false,
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e961ade9-6005-4e57-ade7-617d97c5acd5",
      "name": "Summarize run",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1520,
        -200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "jsCode": "// One item per loan, collected by the loop.\nconst results = $input.all().map((item) => item.json);\nconst failed = results.filter((r) => r.status === 'failed');\nreturn [{\n  json: {\n    total: results.length,\n    sent: results.length - failed.length,\n    failed: failed.length,\n    failedLoans: failed.map((r) => r.loanId),\n  },\n}];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ce82d915-931b-4d2f-ac3d-5b7849141e43",
      "name": "Any reminder failed?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.4,
      "position": [
        1740,
        -200
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": {
            "caseSensitive": true,
            "leftValue": "",
            "typeValidation": "strict",
            "version": 4
          },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "97e756f3-f6ee-44cc-a30b-f8ad65b6969f",
              "leftValue": "={{ $json.failed }}",
              "rightValue": 0,
              "operator": {
                "type": "number",
                "operation": "gt"
              }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "and"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "e0e65204-7c4a-404c-a2d1-22666e620e15",
      "name": "Fail the run",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stopAndError",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1960,
        -300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "errorMessage": "={{ $json.failed }} of {{ $json.total }} overdue reminders could not be sent"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "5af12273-cc58-4b7d-a3f3-830d100f0faf",
      "name": "Done",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.noOp",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1960,
        -120
      ],
      "parameters": {}
    }
  ],
